{"seq":1,"slug":"wireless-propagation-and-antennas","title":"大学通信工程 — 无线传播与天线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile/wireless-propagation-and-antennas","wordCount":2280,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学通信工程-无线传播与天线\">大学通信工程 — 无线传播与天线</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>无线通信的第一步，是让电磁波离开发射机、在空间中行进、再被接收机捕获。承担&quot;发射&quot;和&quot;捕获&quot;任务的器件就是<strong>天线</strong>——它把导线里的电流变成空中的电磁波，或反过来把电磁波变回电流。天线的尺寸与工作波长直接相关，这也解释了为什么早期手机有长长的天线、而 5G 手机的天线却小到看不见（因为频率越高、波长越短、天线越小）。</p>\n<p>电磁波在空间传播时会逐渐衰减，称为<strong>路径损耗</strong>。在自由空间里，接收功率随距离的平方反比下降；在真实城市环境中，衰减更快。除了距离造成的损耗，无线信号还面临三大&quot;敌人&quot;：<strong>多径</strong>（信号经多条路径到达，相互干涉）、<strong>衰落</strong>（信号强度随时间和位置剧烈起伏）、<strong>多普勒效应</strong>（移动导致频率偏移）。理解这些现象，才能明白为什么你在电梯里会断线、为什么高铁上信号会忽好忽坏。</p>\n<p>本课时讲解电磁波的基本传播规律、路径损耗模型、天线的工作原理与关键参数，以及多径、衰落、多普勒这三个无线信道的核心特性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"电磁波与自由空间传播\">电磁波与自由空间传播</h3><p>电磁波由变化的电场和磁场相互激发，以光速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\approx 3\\times10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> m/s 在真空中传播。波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、光速三者关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = \\frac{c}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Wi-Fi 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span> GHz 对应波长约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5</span></span></span></span></span> cm，5G 毫米波 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> GHz 对应波长约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.07</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.07</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.07</span></span></span></span></span> cm。这个简单公式是理解天线尺寸和信号特性的钥匙——频率越高，波长越短，天线越小，但绕过障碍物的能力（衍射）越弱、被墙壁吸收越严重。这正是 5G 毫米波&quot;速度快但覆盖差、怕遮挡&quot;的物理根源。</p>\n<p><strong>自由空间路径损耗（FSPL）</strong> 描述信号在无遮挡空间中随距离的衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FSPL (dB)</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>32.45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FSPL (dB)} = 20\\log_{10}(d) + 20\\log_{10}(f) + 32.45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FSPL (dB)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32.45</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是距离（km），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是频率（MHz）。注意它对距离和频率都是平方关系——距离翻倍，损耗增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> dB（功率减为四分之一）。这解释了为什么离基站越远信号越弱，以及为什么高频段需要部署更密集的基站。</p>\n<h3 id=\"天线-电与波的转换器\">天线：电与波的转换器</h3><p>天线的核心参数有三个：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>通俗理解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增益（Gain）</td>\n<td>把能量集中到特定方向的能力</td>\n<td>像手电筒聚光 vs 灯泡散光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向图</td>\n<td>各方向辐射强度的分布</td>\n<td>信号&quot;照射&quot;的形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极化</td>\n<td>电场振动的方向</td>\n<td>收发天线要&quot;对齐&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>全向天线</strong>（如手机内置天线）向四面八方均匀辐射，增益低但覆盖均匀；<strong>定向天线</strong>（如卫星锅、基站扇区天线）把能量集中在特定方向，增益高但覆盖窄。卫星电视的&quot;锅&quot;就是高增益定向天线，必须精确对准卫星才有信号。增益和覆盖范围之间永远是一对权衡——能量守恒决定了你不可能既照得远又照得广。</p>\n<p><strong>天线尺寸</strong>通常为工作波长的一半（半波偶极子）。FM 收音机天线约一米多长（对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> MHz、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 米波长的一半略短），而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span> GHz 的 Wi-Fi 天线只需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> cm。这就是天线随频率升高而缩小的原因，也是 5G 能在手机里塞进几十根天线做 MIMO 的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多径-衰落与多普勒\">多径、衰落与多普勒</h3><p>真实无线信道远比自由空间复杂。信号离开天线后，会经历三大效应：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;发射天线&quot;] --&gt;|直射| D[&quot;接收天线&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;经墙壁反射&quot;| D&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;经地面反射&quot;| D&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;经建筑物绕射&quot;| D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;多条路径叠加 → 多径效应&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"发射天线\"] --&gt;|直射| D[\"接收天线\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"经墙壁反射\"| D\n    A --&gt;|\"经地面反射\"| D\n    A --&gt;|\"经建筑物绕射\"| D\n    D --&gt; E[\"多条路径叠加 → 多径效应\"]</pre><p><strong>多径效应</strong>：信号经直射、反射、绕射等多条路径到达接收端，各路径延迟不同，叠加时可能相长（增强）也可能相消（抵消）。当你在房间里走动，手机信号忽强忽弱，就是多径相消造成的&quot;死区&quot;。多径还会引起<strong>时延扩展</strong>，导致符号相互拖尾干扰（码间串扰），这是高速数据传输的大敌，也是 OFDM 技术要解决的核心问题。</p>\n<p><strong>衰落（Fading）</strong>：信号强度随时间、位置、频率的随机起伏。慢衰落（阴影衰落）由大型障碍物遮挡引起，如你走到大楼背后信号变弱；快衰落（多径衰落）由多径干涉引起，移动几厘米就可能从信号峰跌到谷。瑞利衰落和莱斯衰落是描述快衰落的两个经典统计模型。</p>\n<p><strong>多普勒效应</strong>：当收发双方相对运动时，接收频率会发生偏移——就像救护车驶近时鸣笛变尖、驶离时变低。频偏量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_d = \\frac{v}{\\lambda}\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0404em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是相对速度。高铁以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>350</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">350</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span></span></span></span></span> km/h 运行时，多普勒频偏可达数百赫兹至上千赫兹，给信号同步带来巨大挑战。这正是高铁专用通信系统需要特殊设计的原因之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对抗信道损伤的技术\">对抗信道损伤的技术</h3><p>工程师发明了多种武器对抗这些损伤：<strong>分集（Diversity）</strong> 用多根天线或多个频率接收同一信号，因为多条路径同时陷入深衰落的概率很低；<strong>均衡（Equalization）</strong> 在接收端补偿信道造成的失真；<strong>MIMO</strong> 更进一步，把多径从&quot;敌人&quot;变成&quot;朋友&quot;——利用丰富的多径环境创造多条并行的空间数据流，成倍提升容量。理解了多径既是挑战又是机遇，你就理解了现代无线技术的精妙之处。</p>\n<h3 id=\"真实场景-为什么地铁里信号时好时坏\">真实场景：为什么地铁里信号时好时坏</h3><p>地铁是无线传播的&quot;地狱模式&quot;。隧道是金属和混凝土构成的封闭管道，信号无法从地面基站直接穿透进来，必须依赖隧道内沿途铺设的<strong>泄漏电缆</strong>（一种特制的同轴电缆，沿线均匀&quot;漏出&quot;信号）。列车高速行驶带来多普勒频偏；车厢金属外壳屏蔽信号；进出站时在隧道与站台的不同覆盖环境间切换——这些因素叠加，造成信号忽强忽弱。运营商通过加密泄漏电缆、优化车厢内分布天线、设计平滑切换算法来改善体验。下次在地铁里盯着信号格起伏时，你已能说出背后那一整套传播物理学了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = c/f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 计算 GPS 信号（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.575</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.575</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.575</span></span></span></span></span> GHz）的波长。据此估算一个半波天线大约多长。</li>\n<li>自由空间路径损耗中，距离翻倍损耗增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> dB。如果你离 Wi-Fi 路由器的距离从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 米增加到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 米，路径损耗大约增加多少 dB？</li>\n<li>为什么 5G 毫米波速度极快，却&quot;怕遮挡、覆盖差&quot;？请从波长、衍射能力和墙壁吸收三个角度分析。</li>\n<li>多径效应既会造成信号相消（死区），又被 MIMO 用来提升容量。请解释这看似矛盾的&quot;敌人变朋友&quot;是如何实现的。</li>\n<li>高铁上为什么信号容易出问题？请结合多普勒效应、快速切换和车厢屏蔽三方面说明。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>用一根几十元的 RTL-SDR 接收棒接收附近飞机的 ADS-B 信号，亲手体验天线、频率和接收范围的关系。</li>\n<li>了解大规模 MIMO（Massive MIMO）和波束赋形（Beamforming）——5G 基站如何用上百根天线把信号&quot;瞄准&quot;特定用户，这是天线技术的当代巅峰。</li>\n<li>阅读关于隧道、地铁、室内分布系统的工程资料，理解真实世界中&quot;信号覆盖&quot;是如何被精心规划出来的。</li>\n<li>探索瑞利衰落和莱斯衰落的统计模型，用 Python 仿真一段衰落信道，直观看到信号强度的随机起伏。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课时建立了无线传播的物理图景。电磁波以光速行进，波长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=c/f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 决定了天线尺寸和信号穿透/绕射能力——频率越高天线越小，但越怕遮挡。自由空间路径损耗随距离和频率的平方增长。天线的增益、方向图、极化三个参数刻画了它如何辐射和接收能量，增益与覆盖范围之间是基本权衡。真实信道还面临多径、衰落、多普勒三大损伤，工程师用分集、均衡、MIMO 等技术对抗甚至化敌为友。理解这些，你就读懂了手机信号格背后的全部物理。下一课时我们学习多址技术，看千万用户如何共享同一片频谱。建议复习：波长公式与天线尺寸的关系，以及多径效应的双面性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学通信工程 — 无线传播与天线","id":"大学通信工程-无线传播与天线"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"电磁波与自由空间传播","id":"电磁波与自由空间传播"},{"level":3,"text":"天线：电与波的转换器","id":"天线-电与波的转换器"},{"level":3,"text":"多径、衰落与多普勒","id":"多径-衰落与多普勒"},{"level":3,"text":"对抗信道损伤的技术","id":"对抗信道损伤的技术"},{"level":3,"text":"真实场景：为什么地铁里信号时好时坏","id":"真实场景-为什么地铁里信号时好时坏"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学通信工程 — 香农信息论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/information-theory"},"next":{"title":"大学通信工程 — 多址技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile/multiple-access"}}